  "instructions": [
    "Heat the sesame oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the sliced pork loin and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger to the skillet and cook for 1 minute.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the yuzu juice, soy sauce, and rice vinegar.",
    "Pour the yuzu sauce into the skillet and bring to a simmer.",
    "Add the udon noodles to the skillet and cook until they are well coated with the sauce.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Serve the noodles and pork in an agave leaf vessel."
  ],
